Error [E0209]: implicit clone of `p`
  --> tests/ui/struct_implicit_clone_move.jet:12:10
    |
 12 |     show(p)
    |          ^
 Why: `show` expects to take ownership of this value
 Fix: write the move-capability marker `^` (`^p`) to move it — this is `p`'s last use — or the copy marker `~` (`~p`) to keep a copy
